NOTE A. Two more runs made after the referee, one seed each. The setting P = 6, cutoff distance 0.1 (3.93 ± 0.06 on two seeds at node spacing 0.1, which is the cutoff distance itself) at node spacing 0.05: 3.83. The lowest setting of the sealed grid (P = 2, cutoff distance 0.8; 3.22 ± 0.01 on four seeds) with half the time step: 3.17. A third, the same corner with necks looked for at every step, was begun and stopped: it could not have finished inside the two hours a background command is allowed.

